# Dealayed

> Your inconvenient and annoying notifier that updates you on deals only **after** they have ended.
>
> But hey, at least you saved money by not buying anything.

**Dealayed** is a satirical Android app built for a hackathon. Instead of helping users find great deals, it reminds them of promotions they already missed. Browse expired promos, get roasted for being too late, and receive notifications about deals you can no longer claim.

---

## Features

### Animated Splash Screen
- Custom **DEALAYED** logo animation
- Letters rush in, recoil, and bounce into place

### Demo Sign-In
- Email and password validation
- Inline error messages
- Loading state feedback
- Show/hide password toggle

### Home Feed
- Browse recently expired deals
- Sorted by how recently each deal ended
- Category filter chips:
  - All
  - Food
  - Movies
  - Travel
  - Shopping

### Deal Details
Tap any deal to view:
- Business name
- Discount information
- Expiration date
- Description
- Promo image
- Original source link

### Search
- Category dropdown filtering
- Recommendations section featuring deals you just missed
- Empty-state support when no results match

### Notifications
Designed to be as passive-aggressive as possible.

Features include:
- Filter chips (All, Missed, Expired, Roasts)
- "Live Shame" banner
- "Cry About It" and "Blame Traffic" buttons
- Unread badges
- "Mark All as Ignored"
- Today and Earlier sections
- Bell shortcut from Home and Search

### Profile
- Total amount overspent
- Missed deals counter
- Membership tiers
- Preference toggles:
  - Expiry Popups
  - Weekly Dealays
- Log out functionality

### Navigation
- Home
- Search
- Profile
- Cross-fade screen transitions

